 "description": "<p>*** 10/27/28 \u2013 Uploading Addem 2 toa revise the Procurement Schedule and to also provide the require 10-day notice of the Cost Opening which is a open public meeting. ***&nbsp;</p><p>*** 9/10/26 \u2013 Uploading Questions &amp; Answers Round 1, Addendum 1 and appendices 1 through 8 from the Procurement Library. ***&nbsp;</p><p>The Florida Department of Revenue, Child Support Program is requesting proposals from qualified Proposers to host a web-based Software as a Service (SAAS) to provide Random Moment Sampling (RMS) for the purpose of determining the percentage of time performing specific activities related to the Title IV-D Program. This RFP is for a sixty-six (66) month contract with five (5) one-year optional renewals.&nbsp;</p>",
